  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Akash Vishwakarma vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 6 November, 2024 Author: Vipin Chandra Dixit Bench: Vipin Chandra Dixit High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:173798-Db Court No. - 40 Case :- Writ - C No. - 27173 of 2024 Akash Vishwakarma vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 6 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/146891130/ 1",
    "facts": "2. This is a petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India wherein the writ petitioner is aggrieved by the order dated March 27, 2024 passed by Assistant Commissioner (Food)-II, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Varanasi rejecting his application for grant of permission to run a hukka bar in the restaurant run by the petitioner. 3. Counsel appearing on behalf of the State-respondent has submitted that this kind of permission could not be granted by the Food Safety Department.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
